# MultiFS module version, in the RISC OS VersionNum style.
#
# The Makefile turns this into version.inc, which supplies the module's help
# string. Bump both fields together when the module changes.
#
# The date is deliberate rather than a true build stamp, as with the other
# modules here: the assembled module is committed and only rebuilt when someone
# runs build.sh --podules, so a real build date would record when that last
# happened. Override with `make MODULE_DATE="..."`.

Module_MajorVersion	0.01
Module_Date		15 Aug 2026
